
## .gitignore

```gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Environment variables
.env

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# Dependency directories
node_modules/

# Optional eslint cache
.eslintcache

# Uploads directory (user uploaded files)
uploads/
temp/

# IDE and editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
